Table full name: bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.versions
Column name: id Type: INT64 Description: The unique primary key of the version in the Libraries.io database.
Column name: platform Type: STRING Description: The name of the Package manager the version is available on.
Column name: project_name Type: STRING Description: The name of the project the version belongs to.
Column name: project_id Type: INT64 Description: The unique primary key of the project for this version in the Libraries.io database.
Column name: number Type: STRING Description: The number of the release often confirms to semantic versioning.
Column name: published_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The timestamp of when the version was published.
Column name: created_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The timestamp of when the version was first detected by Libraries.io.
Column name: updated_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The timestamp of when the version was last saved by Libraries.io.
Sample rows:
[{'id': 3125634, 'platform': 'Atom', 'project_name': 'webflow-to-wordpress', 'project_id': 802627, 'number': '0.0.0', 'published_timestamp': '2015-05-23 19:19:04+00:00', 'created_timestamp': '2015-05-23 19:19:04+00:00', 'updated_timestamp': '2015-05-23 19:19:04+00:00'}, {'id': 3876666, 'platform': 'Atom', 'project_name': 'nuclide-health', 'project_id': 994734, 'number': '0.0.0', 'published_timestamp': '2015-09-28 20:18:41+00:00', 'created_timestamp': '2015-09-28 20:18:41+00:00', 'updated_timestamp': '2015-09-28 20:18:41+00:00'}, {'id': 4455398, 'platform': 'Atom', 'project_name': 'fb-atom-snippets', 'project_id': 1112791, 'number': '0.0.0', 'published_timestamp': '2015-12-07 21:28:37+00:00', 'created_timestamp': '2015-12-07 21:28:37+00:00', 'updated_timestamp': '2015-12-07 21:28:37+00:00'}, {'id': 4222891, 'platform': 'Atom', 'project_name': 'nuclide-busy-signal', 'project_id': 1058135, 'number': '0.0.0', 'published_timestamp': '2015-10-23 21:08:37+00:00', 'created_timestamp': '2015-10-23 21:08:37+00:00', 'updated_timestamp': '2015-10-23 21:08:37+00:00'}, {'id': 3459903, 'platform': 'Atom', 'project_name': 'language-marasm', 'project_id': 929280, 'number': '0.0.0', 'published_timestamp': '2015-08-13 21:38:51+00:00', 'created_timestamp': '2015-08-13 21:38:51+00:00', 'updated_timestamp': '2015-08-13 21:38:51+00:00'}]

